{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold on to your bubbles! Scrubbin\u2019 Trubble is a cooperative turn-based roguelike <i>clean em\u2019 up</i> where you and your buddies each play one of six unique character classes to deal with some of the nastiest grime you\u2019ve ever seen\u2026 and this filth fights back. Sometimes to get clean, you gotta get dirty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/b13f33578aa4d79ae1b2e2d82b2f9000.poster.avif?t=1773684164\" width=616 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/b13f33578aa4d79ae1b2e2d82b2f9000.webm?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/b13f33578aa4d79ae1b2e2d82b2f9000.mp4?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The House, the cleaning <i>and</i> the fights never seem to end. Go it alone or team up with up to three other players to wipe out the Nasties infesting every inch. Think strategically and defeat foes to earn powerful upgrades for the whole team and their special abilities, working your way from one floor to the next. But don\u2019t get too cocky; while running to the next stairs is always an option, if you end up fleeing too much or doing poorly, you may find yourself woefully unprepared to take on the increasingly dangerous detritus on subsequent levels, and if you hit a game over before you scrub out one of the Four Filths of the Apocalypse, you\u2019ll need to start all over from the beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to four players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six different classes with unique skills and strengths to support the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your attacks to add new effects and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on pun-riddled Nasties like Mildude, Asbeastos, Refusphynx, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield items and equipment like &quot;Wiper Rifle&quot; and &quot;Splash Bang&quot; to clean up your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean your way to the top of the leaderboard with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approachable learning curve and quick sessions whether you have a little time, or a lot!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/3a552ef0a88243a6c01720bdd828f20d.poster.avif?t=1773684164\" width=616 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/3a552ef0a88243a6c01720bdd828f20d.webm?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/3a552ef0a88243a6c01720bdd828f20d.mp4?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Odd Object</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odd Object is a new independent game studio based in California and founded by Stevie Hryciw (The Indie Game Legend 3D, Catacomb Kids) and veteran animator and roguelike developer Tyriq Plummer (Cadence of Hyrule, Catacomb Kids, UFO 50). They work with a variety of creators to craft fresh, fun, and colorful games designed to be easy to pick up but hard to put down, combining depth with approachability.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3276700?t=1773684164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3276700?t=1773684164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/55d6f045c9b2409dc3ed46e2389f44e531f1817c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773684164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/55d6f045c9b2409dc3ed46e2389f44e531f1817c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773684164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold on to your bubbles! Scrubbin\u2019 Trubble is a cooperative turn-based roguelike <i>clean em\u2019 up</i> where you and your buddies each play one of six unique character classes to deal with some of the nastiest grime you\u2019ve ever seen\u2026 and this filth fights back. Sometimes to get clean, you gotta get dirty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/b13f33578aa4d79ae1b2e2d82b2f9000.poster.avif?t=1773684164\" width=616 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/b13f33578aa4d79ae1b2e2d82b2f9000.webm?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/b13f33578aa4d79ae1b2e2d82b2f9000.mp4?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The House, the cleaning <i>and</i> the fights never seem to end. Go it alone or team up with up to three other players to wipe out the Nasties infesting every inch. Think strategically and defeat foes to earn powerful upgrades for the whole team and their special abilities, working your way from one floor to the next. But don\u2019t get too cocky; while running to the next stairs is always an option, if you end up fleeing too much or doing poorly, you may find yourself woefully unprepared to take on the increasingly dangerous detritus on subsequent levels, and if you hit a game over before you scrub out one of the Four Filths of the Apocalypse, you\u2019ll need to start all over from the beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to four players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six different classes with unique skills and strengths to support the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your attacks to add new effects and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on pun-riddled Nasties like Mildude, Asbeastos, Refusphynx, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield items and equipment like &quot;Wiper Rifle&quot; and &quot;Splash Bang&quot; to clean up your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean your way to the top of the leaderboard with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approachable learning curve and quick sessions whether you have a little time, or a lot!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/3a552ef0a88243a6c01720bdd828f20d.poster.avif?t=1773684164\" width=616 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/3a552ef0a88243a6c01720bdd828f20d.webm?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/extras/3a552ef0a88243a6c01720bdd828f20d.mp4?t=1773684164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Odd Object</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odd Object is a new independent game studio based in California and founded by Stevie Hryciw (The Indie Game Legend 3D, Catacomb Kids) and veteran animator and roguelike developer Tyriq Plummer (Cadence of Hyrule, Catacomb Kids, UFO 50). They work with a variety of creators to craft fresh, fun, and colorful games designed to be easy to pick up but hard to put down, combining depth with approachability.</p>","developers":["Odd Object"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276700/7b805f9004e24eb71b1d06c8e9573d8489f27be3/header.jpg?t=1773684164","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3276700/260986636/19b61ba44e015c1d93e8efb56cafede1f14d929b/1772746141/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772836907","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3276700/260986636/19b61ba44e015c1d93e8efb56cafede1f14d929b/1772746141/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772836907","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3276700/260986636/19b61ba44e015c1d93e8efb56cafede1f14d929b/1772746141/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772836907","id":257298456,"name":"Launch Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257298456/7154e3ca582f11628557983dbbd10c358582a100/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772836907"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3276700/376094196/98e500599fd6e0c943d0d6dbe4032333e97155d6/1750975204/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748965861","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3276700/376094196/98e500599fd6e0c943d0d6dbe4032333e97155